{"title": "Extort", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">475 Extort</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\">Preview</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\">Icon</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\">In space</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExtortPreView.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ExtortPreView.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExtortPreView.png/250px-ExtortPreView.png?9b12e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExtortPreView.png/375px-ExtortPreView.png?9b12e0 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExtortPreView.png/500px-ExtortPreView.png?9b12e0 2x\" data-file-width=\"889\" data-file-height=\"889\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extort_(Icon).png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Extort (Icon).png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Extort_%28Icon%29.png/250px-Extort_%28Icon%29.png?38242f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/Extort_%28Icon%29.png?38242f 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extort_in_space.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Extort in space.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Extort_in_space.jpg/250px-Extort_in_space.jpg?a06b18\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Extort_in_space.jpg/375px-Extort_in_space.jpg?a06b18 1.5x, /images/thumb/Extort_in_space.jpg/500px-Extort_in_space.jpg?a06b18 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\n&#9646;520</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nA+</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nRainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, Minefield</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-TerrainforCruiser\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-TerrainforCruiser\">Terrain for Cruiser?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-TerrainforCruiser druid-data-nonempty\">\nNot at all</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.15%<br />Mansion: 0.31%<br />Mineshaft: 0.002%<br /><b>Art Gallery: 45.88%</b><br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.02%<br />Carnival: 0.002%<br />Deep Sewers: 7.65%<br />Greenhouse: 0.06%<br />Rubber Rooms: 0.06%<br /><b>Spooky Manor: 45.88%</b></div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n23</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n27</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 5</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nButler, Coil-Head, Masked</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nCircuit Bees, Eyeless Dog, Feiopar, Forest Keeper</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n17</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n6</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n14</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trial:_Grind_The_Deluded\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trial: Grind The Deluded</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Grind_The_Deluded_Videotape\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Grind The Deluded Videotape</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Extort</b> was primarily exploited for its resources as it was rich in nature, oil and various metals. Later on it became a popular spot for travel. Ownership was transferred to the Trite Control Corporation.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExtortMap.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ExtortMap.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExtortMap.jpg/650px-ExtortMap.jpg?8f2162\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"365\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExtortMap.jpg/975px-ExtortMap.jpg?8f2162 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExtortMap.jpg/1300px-ExtortMap.jpg?8f2162 2x\" data-file-width=\"1919\" data-file-height=\"1079\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Cold, snowy terrain. Suffers from frequent hurricanes.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by a few species.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Extort can experience Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, or Hurricane weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trial:_Grind_The_Deluded\">Trial: Grind The Deluded</span></h3>\n<p>This moon features a <b>trial</b> that generates on the exterior. Completing it rewards the player with scrap worth an average of \u25ae378. The <b>specific rewards</b> are <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span> several \"Small diamond\" and one \"Grind the deluded ticket\" scrap.</span></span>\n</p><p><big>To complete this trial:</big>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find the shed with an employee strapped to a table and hooked up to a machine. Go straight and slightly right from the back of the ship past the first hill until you reach a second hill. The shed is at the bottom. This is also where one of the fire exits is.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>To the right of the machine will be three gas canisters and the names of three locations. Take a gas canister to any of these locations. There is a map on the wall in the shed to use as a guide.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>When you reach a location, fuel the generator near the grinder the employee is trapped in with the gas canister. Wait for the employee to be grinded and grab the \"Gore bucket\" that gets filled.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Return to the shed and insert the gore into the machine the employee is hooked up to.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Repeat steps 2-4 two more times.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>There is a hole in the back of the shed to crouch through that leads to a submerged building. Retrieve a blue key that spawns in a random location inside. Jumping prevents drowning.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Return to the shed, press the red button to the left of the employee, and insert the blue key into the key slot to the right of the map as prompted. The rewards will spawn in front of the grinder shortly afterward.</span></span></li></ol>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Inserting the \"Grind the deluded\" videotape that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Descent\" title=\"Descent\">Descent</a> into the projector in <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Release\" title=\"Release\"><big><b>Release:</b></big></a> \"Reshape the incapable\" videotape that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airhorn</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Airhorn.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Airhorn.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/60px-Airhorn.png?6146f4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/90px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Airhorn.png/120px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>1.67%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big bolt</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_bolt.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big bolt.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/60px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/90px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/120px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></