\"thumbborder\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" data-durationhint=\"32\" data-mwtitle=\"ExtortTape2.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/ExtortTape2.mp4?9bf14f\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" /></video>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">The syndicate are families devoting their lives to gain power through contacts and crimes. They need to learn the viciousness of climbing the ladder. I need you to find the crime boss and unite him with his family. Grind his dreams over dinner and we will let you out.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Before <b>\"Obscurity\"</b> video material on \"Grind the deluded\" videotape was different:<br /><br /><video poster=\"/images/thumb/ExtortTape.mp4/300px--ExtortTape.mp4.jpg?2a527b\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" data-durationhint=\"31\" data-mwtitle=\"ExtortTape.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/ExtortTape.mp4?2a527b\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" /></video></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2></div>", "images": ["ExtortPreView.png", "Extort_(Icon).png", "Extort_in_space.jpg", "ExtortMap.jpg", "Information.png", 